WEBVTT

00:00:03.996 --> 00:00:05.597
All right. There you go.

00:00:05.697 --> 00:00:07.867
- (gasps) Yay!
- (coos, babbles happily)

00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:09.267
Thanks, Dr. Nefario.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:11.269
(chuckles) Good as new.

00:00:11.369 --> 00:00:14.140
No job too small or too mad.

00:00:14.239 --> 00:00:16.842
(chuckles) Bye, then.

00:00:16.942 --> 00:00:18.677
Bye.

00:00:20.211 --> 00:00:22.180
(squeals happily)

00:00:26.118 --> 00:00:28.186
Hey. You okay, sweetie?

00:00:28.286 --> 00:00:29.889
(Agnes whimpers softly)

00:00:29.989 --> 00:00:31.057
- GRU: Agnes!
- (gasps)

00:00:31.157 --> 00:00:33.591
Someone's here to see you!

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:36.327
(panting)

00:00:40.365 --> 00:00:42.667
(gasps)
Lucky?

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:46.738
(bleats)

00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:48.040
Lucky!

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:50.475
- (Agnes laughing)
- (Lucky bleats)

00:00:51.177 --> 00:00:52.912
Did you practice your tricks?

00:00:53.012 --> 00:00:55.881
- (bleats)
- Okay, play dead.

00:00:55.981 --> 00:00:58.383
(Lucky gasping)

00:01:00.418 --> 00:01:02.054
(laughing):
Yay!

00:01:02.154 --> 00:01:04.622
Ah, that was... disturbing.

00:01:04.723 --> 00:01:06.324
- Yeah, little bit.
- AGNES: Lucky!

00:01:06.424 --> 00:01:08.727
- (laughing)
- (bleating)

00:01:09.461 --> 00:01:11.831
Hey, I'll, uh...
I'll be back soon.

00:01:11.931 --> 00:01:13.264
- Oh. Okay.
- Mwah.

00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:15.567
There's something
I need to take care of.

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:16.802
Mwah.

00:01:16.902 --> 00:01:18.037
See you later, buddy.

00:01:18.137 --> 00:01:19.270
Love you, honey.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:21.740
Da-da-da. (giggles)

00:01:22.774 --> 00:01:25.477
♪

00:01:26.812 --> 00:01:29.547
(sighs heavily)
How you doing, Maxime?

00:01:29.647 --> 00:01:32.118
(sighs)
What are you doing here, Gru?

00:01:32.218 --> 00:01:33.986
You came to gloat, no?

00:01:34.086 --> 00:01:35.420
Gloat? No, no, no, no. I just...

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.923
I wanted to get something
off my chest.

00:01:38.023 --> 00:01:39.491
- (scoffs)
- And it concerns

00:01:39.591 --> 00:01:42.194
the ninth grade talent show.

00:01:42.293 --> 00:01:46.198
Well, actually...

00:01:46.297 --> 00:01:49.667
- I did steal your song.
- What?

00:01:49.768 --> 00:01:50.936
I knew it!

00:01:51.036 --> 00:01:52.270
I knew there was no coincidence.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:53.939
You little liar!

00:01:54.039 --> 00:01:55.607
(grunting)

00:01:55.707 --> 00:01:56.809
Well?

00:01:56.909 --> 00:01:58.144
Well, what?

00:01:58.244 --> 00:01:59.544
- Well, where's my apology?
- Apol...

00:01:59.644 --> 00:02:01.180
What are you talking about?

00:02:01.279 --> 00:02:02.982
I just apologized.

00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:04.250
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:02:04.349 --> 00:02:06.152
No, that was no apology.

00:02:06.252 --> 00:02:08.286
You just wanted to rub it in.

00:02:08.386 --> 00:02:11.223
I can't believe
you stole my song.

00:02:11.322 --> 00:02:13.225
Hey, I only did that
to get back at you

00:02:13.324 --> 00:02:15.127
for pantsing me
at the homecoming dance.

00:02:15.227 --> 00:02:17.163
- (chuckles)
- Besides,

00:02:17.263 --> 00:02:18.798
you could've gone on after me.

00:02:18.898 --> 00:02:22.034
It is not my fault
that you were afraid.

00:02:22.134 --> 00:02:25.037
Afraid because I killed it!

00:02:25.137 --> 00:02:26.471
Afraid? Ha!

00:02:26.571 --> 00:02:29.008
I could outsing you
any day of the week

00:02:29.108 --> 00:02:30.575
and all day Sunday.

00:02:30.675 --> 00:02:33.245
(laughs)
I'd like to see that.

00:02:33.344 --> 00:02:35.413
Anytime, anyplace.

00:02:35.513 --> 00:02:37.515
You name it, <i>mon ami.</i>

00:02:37.615 --> 00:02:40.119
("Everybody Wants
to Rule the World" playing)

00:02:40.219 --> 00:02:42.487
(quiet chatter)

00:02:45.991 --> 00:02:48.093
(laughing excitedly)

00:02:48.194 --> 00:02:50.296
Oh, yeah.

00:02:50.395 --> 00:02:53.631
♪ Welcome to your life

00:02:53.731 --> 00:02:54.465
Aah!

00:02:54.566 --> 00:02:57.837
♪ There's no turning back

00:02:57.937 --> 00:02:59.038
Aah!

00:02:59.138 --> 00:03:02.208
♪ Even while we sleep

00:03:02.308 --> 00:03:03.441
Oh, come on!

00:03:03.541 --> 00:03:04.844
♪ We will find you

00:03:04.944 --> 00:03:07.246
- ♪ Act...
- ♪ ...ing on your

00:03:07.345 --> 00:03:09.380
♪ Best behavior

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:13.718
♪ Turn your back
on Mother Nature ♪

00:03:13.819 --> 00:03:19.091
♪ Everybody wants
to rule the world ♪

00:03:19.191 --> 00:03:21.359
- Yes!
- Woo-hoo! Yeah!

00:03:21.459 --> 00:03:23.761
- (cheering)
- (dog barking)

00:03:25.231 --> 00:03:26.598
(groans)

00:03:26.698 --> 00:03:29.400
♪ It's my own design

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.836
Uh-huh. Oh, yeah.

00:03:30.936 --> 00:03:33.771
- ♪ It's my own remorse
- (laughing)

00:03:33.873 --> 00:03:36.374
- Let's boogie!
- ♪ Help me

00:03:36.474 --> 00:03:38.177
(muffled):
♪ To decide

00:03:38.277 --> 00:03:40.012
(Minions whooping, hollering)

00:03:40.112 --> 00:03:46.151
♪ Help me make the most
of freedom and of pleasure ♪

00:03:46.252 --> 00:03:50.388
♪ Nothing ever lasts forever

00:03:50.488 --> 00:03:52.324
- ♪ Everybody
- (laughs) -Yeah!

00:03:52.423 --> 00:03:54.726
- ♪ Wants to rule the world
- Whoo! -Ha-ha!

00:03:54.827 --> 00:03:59.098
♪ There's a room where
the light won't find you ♪

00:03:59.198 --> 00:04:03.601
♪ Holding hands while the walls
come tumbling down ♪

00:04:03.701 --> 00:04:07.306
♪ When they do,
I'll be right behind you ♪

00:04:07.405 --> 00:04:11.877
♪ So glad we've almost made it

00:04:11.977 --> 00:04:16.248
SILAS (singing along):
♪ So sad they had to fade it

00:04:16.348 --> 00:04:18.284
♪ Pom-pom, pom-pom

00:04:18.384 --> 00:04:20.853
♪ Tra-la, la-la-la

00:04:22.553 --> 00:04:27.192
♪ Everybody wants
to rule the world ♪

00:04:27.293 --> 00:04:31.562
♪ Say that you'll never, never,
never, never need it ♪

00:04:31.663 --> 00:04:35.466
♪ One headline,
why believe it? ♪

00:04:35.566 --> 00:04:40.505
♪ Everybody wants
to rule the world ♪

00:04:40.605 --> 00:04:42.573
MINION:
Woo-hoo!

00:04:42.674 --> 00:04:44.877
♪ All for freedom

00:04:44.977 --> 00:04:47.313
- ♪ And for pleasure
- (Gru Jr. laughing)

00:04:47.413 --> 00:04:51.417
♪ Nothing ever lasts forever

00:04:51.516 --> 00:04:54.585
♪ Everybody wants to

00:04:54.686 --> 00:04:59.858
♪ Rule the world.

00:04:59.959 --> 00:05:02.861
- (song ends)
- GRU: <i>Oh, yeah.</i>

00:05:04.296 --> 00:05:07.032
(snoring)

00:05:07.132 --> 00:05:08.700
(startled grunting)

00:05:09.401 --> 00:05:10.836
Bello?

00:05:12.137 --> 00:05:14.273
Bello!

00:05:14.373 --> 00:05:15.941
(whimpers)

00:05:16.976 --> 00:05:19.211
(grunting)

00:05:19.311 --> 00:05:21.546
(repeated banging and grunting)

